{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate GPS location, time details and photo for all parcel delivery companies",
        "additional_details": "Every day, thousands of consumers experience parcels being delivered to the wrong address. Courier companies often provide a photograph as proof of delivery, but this frequently fails to identify where the parcel has been left. We call on the UK Government to introduce legislation requiring :\r\n\u2022 The GPS location at point of delivery\r\n\u2022 The time of delivery\r\n\u2022 The estimated accuracy of the recorded location\r\n\u2022 A map showing the recorded delivery location alongside the delivery photograph\r\n",
        "background": "Mandate that all parcel delivery companies provide recipients with GPS location recorded at delivery, time, estimated GPS accuracy & a map showing the delivery location alongside the proof-of-delivery photo. This should only be available to the intended recipient and comply with UK data protection.",
        "closed_at": null,
